{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:175","content":{"id":175,"title":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","content":[{"children":[{"text":"适应性免疫细胞需要从胸腺这所“杀手大学”中毕业，比如 T 细胞。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"de208d7b-34dc-4a34-93ed-ebb964414914","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d6767456-7f64-4298-8f67-ed6f600641cf","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_841f3e04-7d09-4dce-a395-9e74a1922565.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_841f3e04-7d09-4dce-a395-9e74a1922565.png"},{"children":[{"text":"每个 T 细胞生来都有某一特殊受体，可以识别某一种特殊抗原，肯定有很多 T 细胞的受体可以与自身细胞的蛋白结合，这就是自身免疫性疾病。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"82a9ce40-c951-4f0a-bfeb-3c7de06c808d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"自身免疫性疾病就是适应性免疫系统把自身细胞当成了敌人和异物","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5d9f27ad-126e-4958-a95b-3c8858412481","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"73b1916e-1607-49b8-814b-0a56d8d537a2","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","type":"blockquote"},{"children":[{"text":"T 细胞在胸腺接受训练：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"47704aa0-4144-4e9a-bc2a-be80105562d9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"确保 T 细胞能够生成有效的 T 细胞受体","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"839a074f-0bba-48a4-9f7f-42c4789020d7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6e238648-a07b-4e97-b3c6-acce2f352fc0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"查看 T 细胞是否擅长识别合作细胞的受体","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d5ae4481-849a-4839-a85c-d989f3fce845","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"77c36585-7cf5-40e7-980c-0e946bbafdf2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"T 细胞会不会识别自身的细胞","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"17f8d929-c4d9-4695-b4e1-b79d8e739bb6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3ea0ac95-0f4e-4688-8ad1-65ed10ad011e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7bfb8297-bb86-4c7d-a9c1-586e14949040","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"胸腺中存在只有在心脏、胰腺、肝脏等器官中才会出现的蛋白质，以及各种激素，如胰岛素，如果 T 细胞能识别其中任何一种，就会被干掉。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1771b4e7-9f0c-4267-9b8f-b86129b53af4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"胸腺在关停过程中，在幼儿期就开始萎缩、青春期退化的更快，到了 85 岁左右，就永久关停了，从此免疫力大大减弱，此时只能靠成熟的 T 细胞。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d6f86915-4086-477d-88c3-10b9883c21af","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:175","type":"doc","id":175}}],"prevPage":{"title":"17 烹饪美味的受体菜谱","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:174","type":"doc","id":174}},"nextPage":{"title":"19 抗原层递","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:203","type":"doc","id":203}},"createTime":1740095614307,"updateTime":1793532536964,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532536964}}